  "ruleText": "Rev 1501.08 “Lessor” means the entity who conveys the rights of occupancy and use to others under a lease agreement.\n\nSource. #5334, eff 2-26-92; EXPIRED 2-26-98\n\nNew. #6731, eff 4-18-98, EXPIRES: 4-18-06; ss by #8652, eff 6-6-06 ss by #10662, eff 8-27-14; ss by #13977, eff 5-23-24",
